summary:
  main.qml calls the face shown only while the popup is open.

history:
  The closing flush and the volume poll in main.qml hang on
  root.faceShown. Fed by the popup alone, closing the popup under a window
  that is up would flush and slow the poll while the listener is looking
  at the window.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
      readonly property bool faceShown: playerWindow.faceShown

replace:
      readonly property bool faceShown: playerWindow.popupOpen

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_face_asks_whether_it_is_on_screen_in_one_place.
  Line-neutral.
